WEBVTT

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:12.430
Face it, Haruto Amo.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.430
Face your past.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:18.930
Who is she?

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.430
What do you mean?

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:25.600
I mean what I said.
Don't confuse Haruto.

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.650
Don't show up anymore.

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:31.240
The fact I can't log out is a bug!

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:34.070
I'm not a ghost or an NPC!

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:37.410
No. You're a piece of residual data.

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:40.080
-Residual?
-You're leftovers.

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:43.250
You're so mean, Satsuki.

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.580
How can you say that?

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:49.590
You once cared about what I had to say!

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:52.130
It's already been six years!

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:54.550
I'm not the only one who changed.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:57.470
Everything changed. But...

00:00:59.010 --> 00:01:02.980
Haruto is the one who changed the most.

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:25.920
Seven Senses of the Re'Union

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:39.950
The Promise

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:45.450
You can tell, right?

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.960
That Haruto is different.

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:49.710
Yeah.

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:54.130
After that incident,
Haruto became emotionless.

00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:58.130
It's like he lost half of who he was.

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:02.430
He withdrew within himself.

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:06.430
Your death changed Haruto.

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:08.100
I...

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:10.230
Stay away from Haruto.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:13.610
Don't hurt him anymore.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:15.860
I'm not dead!

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:18.990
I'm alive! I am alive!

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.320
You can't use the Prophet Art now

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:24.950
because your brain isn't giving off
electrical signals.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:28.500
It's because you don't have a body in real life.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:30.620
I used it yesterday.

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:33.130
It must have been a coincidence.

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:35.540
I really saw it.

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:37.920
What do you mean, six years?

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:40.880
You changed, and Haruto changed too.

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:42.840
That's reality...

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:44.890
for us.

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:50.180
So, you just watched Haruto change
without saying anything?

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:54.690
-If I was there...
-If you were there!?

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:57.320
You think he wouldn't have changed!?

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:59.440
The reason he changed was--

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:01.320
It doesn't matter why!

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:05.530
-I'm talking about you!
-That's why I'm here talking to you--

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:07.280
Knock it off!

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:10.000
I'm different from back then!

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:12.540
I'm different!

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:16.920
So, leave me alone.

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:27.930
Today, rain is in the forecast throughout the country.

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:31.890
The rain and wind
are expected to get worse in the afternoon,

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:33.600
so, please be careful.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:39.690
Satsuki.

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:43.610
Sorry for coming over so suddenly.

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:45.070
It's okay.

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:48.200
You used to come over for no reason.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:51.910
I want to apologize to you for yesterday.

00:04:52.710 --> 00:04:54.710
There's something I want to tell you.

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:56.710
Something to tell me?

00:04:57.170 --> 00:05:00.750
I didn't want to lose to Asahi.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:04.130
I kept being stubborn.

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:09.140
If she was still alive, we would have
clashed with each other.

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.100
She disappeared after she won.

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:14.310
There's no way to win against
someone once they're dead.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.440
It didn't seem that way to me.

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:22.110
I got mad and was mean to her.

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:24.280
I don't want to lose this time.

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:27.280
Even if it's a game.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:30.120
Do you believe she's the real Asahi?

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:33.870
What about you?

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.580
I...

00:05:37.880 --> 00:05:40.630
Anyway, I'm going to go again.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:42.550
I want to win this time.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:47.930
When you talk about winning and losing,
what do you mean?

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:51.890
Thanks for the towel.

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:54.140
Sure.

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:56.730
It's okay if you don't understand.

00:05:57.020 --> 00:05:59.440
I'm just declaring my goal.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:01.900
I'm even more confused now.

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:04.320
Hey.

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.030
You made a promise

00:06:08.820 --> 00:06:11.280
right before the last quest, right?

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:14.290
A promise? With you?

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:18.290
Hey. Here.

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:22.420
The ring?
You still had it?

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:24.550
I had put it away somewhere.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:28.550
What about this?

00:06:29.220 --> 00:06:32.470
Nice. It's the perfect symbol for Subaru.

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:35.180
You're right! What do you think, Haruto?

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:37.940
Yeah. What do you think, Takanori?

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:41.310
It's good. I'll send one to Clive.

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:44.070
Now we're all Subaru,

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:46.400
both in the game and in real life.

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:49.660
Let's make a promise!

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:54.740
It's okay if you don't remember.

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:56.330
Wait a minute!

00:06:58.120 --> 00:07:00.420
Haruto? What's wrong?

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:08.340
Haruto!? Hey!

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:15.100
What are you doing?

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:20.350
Here it is.

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:24.650
-A ring?
-Yeah. My ring.

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:27.320
What's it doing here?

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:31.660
Asahi wanted to exchange rings in real life too.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:35.450
But we lost our chance to...

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:37.370
I see.

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:41.670
-So, that was your promise to Asahi.
-Huh?

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:47.050
I saw you making a promise to her

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:48.800
before the quest.

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:53.390
Now that you mention it...

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:57.560
I remember making
a promise to her.

00:07:57.720 --> 00:08:00.060
Wasn't this it?

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:03.190
No. It was something else.

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:06.820
But I just remembered something important.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.570
We used to

00:08:09.940 --> 00:08:12.950
help each other solve problems, right?

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:16.410
Yeah. Whenever there was trouble,

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:18.540
we'd help each other.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.950
In real life and in the game.

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:24.080
That's what we did in Subaru.

00:08:27.340 --> 00:08:30.300
I almost abandoned her again.

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:32.470
Are you going?

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:35.390
I'm not much use now,

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:37.140
but I want to help her.

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:39.220
Even if it's only a little.

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:41.230
Then let's go together again.

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:44.440
Yeah. Let's go back
to Re'Union.

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:51.240
These are gerberas, Asahi's favorite.

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:54.610
Was someone else already here?

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:02.080
Are you sure you don't need to say hi?

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.620
It's not necessary.

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:17.840
-Asahi!
-Okay!

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:29.310
It's another miss. That item never appears.

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:31.360
It's a rare drop.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:35.360
Why do you want magic tree sap all of a sudden?

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:39.620
You'll see soon.
You're free until Satsuki gets here, right?

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:42.790
She said she'll be an hour late.

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.370
She should be here in 30 minutes.

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:46.920
We've got to hurry!

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:48.580
Asahi! Behind you!

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:54.010
Asahi!
Don't attack too much and leave your back open!

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:55.760
I'm okay! Leave it to me!

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:58.890
Huh? Where did it go?

00:09:59.930 --> 00:10:02.260
I was waiting for this!

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:05.270
No! Haruto!

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:13.280
Oh! It dropped one!

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:22.950
-Are you okay?
-Yeah.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:25.160
You're so careless!

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:27.620
No! That was my plan!

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:30.000
If it catches me, I don't have to look for it.

00:10:30.170 --> 00:10:31.790
Oh well.

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:33.500
Just one.

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:36.300
I wish it dropped two more.

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:39.630
Don't be so greedy.
The drop rate is low...

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:43.350
Why are you naked?

00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:46.060
I don't want to wear wet clothes.

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:48.140
It's going to dry fast here.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:50.310
You didn't have to take off
your underwear!

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:54.320
Why are you mad?
We always take baths together.

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:57.780
-What are you talking about?
-20 magic tree saps? That's tough!

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:00.490
-Damn it!
-Accessories made out of that sap

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:02.620
will compensate the Shapeshifting Sense.

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:04.580
Come on! Darn!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:09.750
Haruto?

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:12.170
Darn!

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:14.800
They're already making out! It's still early!

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:16.880
How annoying.

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:18.300
Let's go somewhere else.

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:21.640
Keep that stuff in real life, guys.

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:25.260
Haruto, that hurts.

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:27.140
Sorry.

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:30.690
Asahi?

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:39.530
You used to be fine
even if I was naked.

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:43.620
If six years went by for me too,

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:45.700
I wonder if my mom would scold me?

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:48.080
Of course she would!

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:56.380
I want to see my mom and dad.

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:59.210
I want to see everyone in real life.

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:01.340
Asahi...

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:06.300
-I can't, right?
-Huh?

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:11.520
I tried logging out many times at the inn,
but I couldn't.

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:15.060
I kept thinking, "maybe this time..."

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:21.070
You don't have to force yourself to laugh.

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:23.910
Don't push yourself
when you're with me.

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:29.120
Sorry for what I said yesterday.

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:36.460
No...
I'm glad you came back.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.840
I'll do something about this...

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:45.140
LION HEART KING
COEUR DE LION

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:46.970
HARUTO AMO

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:55.850
Satsuki!

00:12:59.070 --> 00:13:01.110
They stunned me! I can't move!

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:03.900
Someone...
Help me!

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:10.740
Haruto...

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:13.370
Never mess with a fighter!

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:18.130
If you want to bite her,
you have to beat me first!

00:13:21.510 --> 00:13:23.220
That was close.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:25.510
Why did you do something so risky?

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:27.760
What if you got a game over?

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:31.310
You know why!
No matter how strong you get,

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:34.140
my job is to be your shield!

00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:50.200
It has no effect,

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:52.410
but I made the shape you wanted.

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:54.040
Thanks!

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:57.540
-Look, Haruto.
-That's...

00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:59.880
It's our party ring!

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:02.050
I wanted to wear one again.

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:06.050
So, that's why you were collecting
magic tree sap?

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:09.800
This is yours, Haruto.

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:12.930
-Why?
-I don't need it.

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:15.100
-You wear it.
-But...

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:17.060
We can make mine later.

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.580
What?

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:36.580
Just wear it.

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:38.160
Okay!

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:45.130
Thanks for waiting, Satsuki.

00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:50.050
Where did you two go?

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:51.930
The blacksmith.

00:14:52.100 --> 00:14:55.390
Look! I made a party ring for Subaru.

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:56.980
There's only one for now.

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.480
It looks good.

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:04.110
I found a design on some parchment
in the base yesterday.

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:05.980
I had him make one.

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:08.990
You found a good blacksmith.

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:10.740
Huh?

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:13.580
Did you put it on yourself?

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:16.790
No. Haruto put it on for me.

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:19.250
What?

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:21.750
Do you know what this means?

00:15:21.920 --> 00:15:24.000
I don't understand your question.

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:26.380
I don't believe this.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:28.470
Her ring finger on her left hand!

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:32.010
I always knew you were an airhead, but...
No way.

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:34.930
-What are you saying?
-Looks like you've gotten worse in six years.

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:36.260
It's...

00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:39.270
nothing!

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:43.020
Hey. Give me the parchment.

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:44.650
Okay. Here.

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:50.700
What's wrong with Satsuki?

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:52.200
Who knows.

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.870
I made one too.

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:03.920
I had one magic tree sap.

00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:06.670
You didn't have to make one in such a hurry.

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:10.380
Shut up. I just felt like it.

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:14.510
Right! We're a step closer to reviving Subaru!

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:18.180
-Satsuki, hurry up and put it on!
-I know.

00:16:22.730 --> 00:16:23.940
What?

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:25.690
It's nothing!

00:16:27.520 --> 00:16:30.440
Great! Now we have two!

00:16:31.150 --> 00:16:33.450
So, what are you going to do today?

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.910
I've decided...

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:44.620
No way. I never thought we'd come here again.

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:49.710
This is the only place we can look
for clues about what happened to Asahi.

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:52.470
Anyway, the quest has ended.

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:54.970
We're not here to fight.

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:58.600
The three of us can't fight the boss alone.

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:02.310
We're just here to get back the memories you lost.

00:17:02.480 --> 00:17:04.560
You're really kind, Haruto.

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:06.980
No, don't hug me!

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:09.730
But you let me hug you before...

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:11.860
Before?

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:13.860
No!

00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:15.740
Don't worry about it.

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:18.910
Why don't we call Clive and Nozomi?

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:20.990
I bet Takanori would come too.

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:24.580
I don't know where Clive and Nozomi are.

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:26.920
I don't even know if they're in Re'Union.

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:30.380
Why? We used to be together all the time.

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:33.670
A lot happens in six years.

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:37.010
Asahi, can you remember anything?

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:40.640
Huh? I can't answer so suddenly.

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:43.100
Anything? Even something small?

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:49.980
It can't be helped.
Let's leave for now.

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:53.820
Yeah. I don't want to stay here long.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:00.780
Asahi?

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:02.870
Someone's over there.

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:05.410
What are you talking about?
There's no one there.

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.420
The time has come.

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:09.710
Who are you? Where are you?

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:12.590
What's wrong? Did you feel anything, Haruto?

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:14.590
No. If there was someone there,

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:17.010
my Fighting Sense should have sensed it first.

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:21.430
Elicia!?

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:40.320
No way.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.830
Purgatorio!

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.040
What are we going to do?

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:48.460
Satsuki, do you have any items for returning?

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:52.590
I do, but we have to get out of this room first.

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:54.710
But something's wrong here.

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:56.840
It didn't have red eyes before, right?

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:04.760
This is bad! The exit--

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:06.890
If we can't run, we have to fight!

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:09.100
Are you serious!? I--

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:11.860
It'll be okay. We can fight! We can win!

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:13.360
Do you understand?

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:16.190
You don't have the ability to read the future now!

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:22.570
If we die, it's game over!

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:24.330
Haruto won't lose!

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.330
We don't have time to argue.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.080
Use everything you've got!

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:33.840
I don't have that many yet, but here I go.
Izayoi!

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:49.980
-Did it work?
-It did, but...

00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:56.610
It looks like it can't penetrate
the magic barrier.

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:00.450
Satsuki!

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:07.120
Oh, no!

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:08.830
Stun!?

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:12.000
This always...

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:13.540
Satsuki!

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:20.510
Stop, Asahi! Run away!

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:22.260
No! I'm not running away!

00:20:23.970 --> 00:20:26.510
That's enough! I'm begging you. Run away!

00:20:26.720 --> 00:20:30.020
Not yet! We made a promise...

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:34.270
-Asahi!
-Wendy Bullet!

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:43.320
I can't move!

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:48.280
Come on! Anything! Just...

00:20:48.910 --> 00:20:50.540
Just give me strength!

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:56.040
The party ring!?

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:02.090
Would you

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:04.260
make a promise with me?

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:07.800
I'll protect you.

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:12.350
So you protect me.

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:14.690
Promise me, okay?

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:16.310
A promise.

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:18.730
Right. That's why...

00:21:18.900 --> 00:21:22.190
Back then... and today too... Asahi...

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:26.700
Run away...

00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:29.200
Haruto.

00:21:29.830 --> 00:21:32.290
I will never...

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:35.210
ever...

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:39.000
I will never run away again!

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:43.300
Haruto?

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:53.560
Leonidas!

00:21:58.650 --> 00:21:59.810
We did it!

00:21:59.980 --> 00:22:01.320
We're not done yet!

00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:14.080
I know! Arcturus!

00:22:37.390 --> 00:22:40.650
I was right, right?
Haruto won't lose!

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:43.940
Hey! I told you not to hug me!

00:22:44.940 --> 00:22:47.320
Your Sense came back,

00:22:48.110 --> 00:22:49.700
Coeur de Lion.

00:22:49.860 --> 00:22:52.910
I forgot you used to call me that.

00:22:53.450 --> 00:22:57.160
That was the first time a vision of the future
was sent to my mind.

00:22:57.540 --> 00:23:01.170
Yeah! I wanted to show you in your minds directly.

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:03.250
-I did it!
-Asahi.

00:23:04.380 --> 00:23:07.590
-What?
-I've changed my mind.

00:23:09.090 --> 00:23:11.300
That was definitely the Prophet Art.

00:23:11.800 --> 00:23:14.180
In other words, you're alive.

00:23:14.350 --> 00:23:15.890
You're not dead.

00:23:18.770 --> 00:23:21.190
I knew you'd understand, Satsuki! Right?

00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:26.190
So, I'll make sure you're able to log out.
No matter what.

00:23:26.360 --> 00:23:28.740
Me too. I promised.

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:32.200
Thanks. Then let's make another promise.

00:23:34.660 --> 00:23:37.200
This is our declaration as Subaru.

00:23:37.580 --> 00:23:40.460
-We trust our friends.
-Let's skip the rest.

00:23:40.670 --> 00:23:43.460
In the name of our sworn bond.

00:23:43.630 --> 00:23:44.710
And...

00:23:47.300 --> 00:23:49.550
Let's all become legends together!

00:23:56.930 --> 00:23:58.520
So many problems.

00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:01.270
It's useless to think about what you don't know.

00:24:01.440 --> 00:24:04.190
On tests, you skip questions you don't know.

00:24:04.650 --> 00:24:06.730
Episode 4, "Dissonance."

00:24:07.110 --> 00:24:09.780
I'm the one who taught you how to do that.
